    <Label layout="10.0,80.0,940.0,20.0" text="  AI HEARTBEAT — a stopwatch that restarts at every API from the AI (3rd party)" font="bold 10.0pt sans-serif" foreground="white" background="#2c3e50" halign="left"/>

