    <Label layout="38.0,800.0,880.0,20.0" text="Slew limit: CHWST 0.3 K/min · DP 0.15 bar/min · CDS 0.5 K/min on EVERY change of the ACTIVE setpoint (AI ⇄ LOCAL, AI steps, optimiser)." font="8.5pt sans-serif" foreground="#c9d3dd" halign="left"/>

    <Label layout="38.0,820.0,880.0,20.0" text="User LOCAL wins at once (mode). After a restart the setpoints start at the safe maximum and glide down." font="8.5pt sans-serif" foreground="#c9d3dd" halign="left"/>

    <Rect fill="#1f252c" stroke="#3b4652" pen="1.0" geom="24.0,874.0,912.0,186.0"/>

    <Label layout="24.0,874.0,912.0,20.0" text="  HOW IT WORKS" font="bold 10.0pt sans-serif" foreground="white" background="#2c3e50" halign="left"/>

    <Label layout="38.0,898.0,890.0,22.0" text="1. The AI writes a new heartbeat value every few minutes. Any new value = one API received → the stopwatch restarts from 0." font="9.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#dde3ea" halign="left"/>

    <Label layout="38.0,925.0,890.0,22.0" text="2. Stopwatch ≥ Step 1 → PRE-DISCONNECT: warning only, the AI stays in control with its last setpoints." font="9.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#dde3ea" halign="left"/>

    <Label layout="38.0,952.0,890.0,22.0" text="3. Stopwatch ≥ Step 2 → DISCONNECTED: plant to LOCAL (setpoints glide), the API count starts again from 0." font="9.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#dde3ea" halign="left"/>

    <Label layout="38.0,979.0,890.0,22.0" text="4. APIs come back → RECONNECTING until the required number of APIs → CONNECTED → AI (if the user selected AI)." font="9.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#dde3ea" halign="left"/>

    <Label layout="38.0,1006.0,890.0,22.0" text="5. The time between the last two APIs is shown, so Step 1 / Step 2 can be set from the real period (e.g. period 5 min → 6 / 12 min)." font="9.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#dde3ea" halign="left"/>

    <Label layout="38.0,1033.0,890.0,22.0" text="6. Station restart: AI only after 2 fresh APIs. The AI must write a NEW value each time (same value twice = no API)." font="9.0pt sans-serif" foreground="#dde3ea" halign="left"/>

